# EX-5 reader candidate: Gemma 4 12B at a 16K window (fully on the GPU; the closest comparison).
#
#   ollama pull gemma4:12b
#   ollama create gemma4-12b-16k -f docs/ollama/Modelfile.gemma4-12b-16k
#
# The window is set here because Ollama's OpenAI-compatible route, which qalpha.live.localmodel
# speaks, has nowhere to put num_ctx (see Modelfile.qwen3-8b-32k). 16K is where the plan starts: the
# context needs memory of its own, and it is raised only after VRAM, RAM and speed are measured with
# the evening pipeline running. The reader sizes its batches to this window (readers.LOCAL_CONTEXT).
#
# A candidate, not a registered reader. It is pinned (scripts/models.py pin) only if the comparison
# under reports/PREREGISTRATION_EX5_READERS.md selects it.
FROM gemma4:12b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
